{"id":"16-2075-2-4","zh":"lubha，表示贪求。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-2075-5-6","zh":"lubbhati（贪求）。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-2075-7-11","zh":"他倚靠着自己的膝盖站着。","confidence":70}
{"id":"16-2075-12-35","zh":"lubbhanaṃ（贪求）、lobho（贪）、lubbhitvā、lubbhitvāna、lubbhiya、lubbhiyāna、olubbhitvā、olubbhitvāna、olubbhiya、olubbhiyāna、lubbhituṃ、olubbhituṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"16-2076-2-17","zh":"其中，**lobho**（贪）是指：众生凭它而贪求，或者它自己贪求，或者它仅仅是贪求本身，所以叫 lobho。","confidence":80}
{"id":"16-2076-18-39","zh":"此外，应当知道“lobho（贪）、lubbhanā（贪求）、lubbhitattaṃ（贪求的状态）、rāgo（染）、taṇhā（渴爱）、tasiṇā（渴求）、mucchā（迷恋）、ejā（动摇）、vanaṃ（欲林）、vanatho（欲丛）”等，都是贪的多种名称。","confidence":75}
